# Helicity: only the 2024-publication material is shared — Code/ and the
# raw .txt data in Data/2024/. Every other Helicity folder (DeepQCD,
# DeepQCDConstraint, HelicityITDplots, RealLim, Report, Data/2026*, ...)
# is post-publication work and stays private.
Helicity/*
!Helicity/Code/
!Helicity/Data/

# Data: nothing under any Data/ folder is shared (generated .csv frames,
# zips, logs, newer data), except the raw .txt files of Helicity/Data/2024.
**/Data/**
!Helicity/Data/2024/
!Helicity/Data/2024/*.txt

**/OtherWay/**

